raints：画面中只能出现一位可见的成年东方女性、一柄长剑、一片连续的山脉、云海、悬空石台和一座远处山门。禁止第二个人物、重复人物、重复长剑、现代建筑、游戏式能量光效、闪电法术、衣服突然变化、长发断裂、长剑漂浮脱离、身体变形、额外肢体、字幕、标志、水印或可读文字。\noverall_soundscape：\n高空风声和云层穿行声贯穿全片。长剑高速飞行时产生克制的空气切割声，衣料和长发随风摆动。人物对白来自画外并保持清晰，不能被风声完全覆盖。云层分开时加入柔和的气流变化声。\nnon_diegetic_music：\n加入宏大但克制的东方仙侠配乐，以低音弦乐、竹笛、古琴拨弦和极轻的鼓点组成。音乐在飞出云层、看见金色山门的瞬间稍微增强，但不要使用压抑或过度激烈的战斗音乐。", 1344, 768, 73], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 241, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 242, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "first_frame", "link": 264, "label": "first_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "first_frame"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "last_frame", "label": "last_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "last_frame"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 265, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 266, "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "length"}, "name": "length", "link": 247, "label": "length", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "length"}], "flags": {}, "id": 133, "type": "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo"}, "order": 19}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [282, 283], "label": "output", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "output"}, {"name": "denoised_output", "label": "denoised_output", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "denoised_output"}], "size": [230, 140], "pos": [1778.189208984375, 4784.55908203125], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "noise", "link": 285, "label": "noise", "type": "NOISE", "localized_name": "noise"}, {"name": "guider", "link": 301, "label": "guider", "type": "GUIDER", "localized_name": "guider"}, {"name": "sampler", "link": 278, "label"